<title>AUSTRIA: Austria cenbank allots 8.49 bln in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria cenbank allots 8.49 bln in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allotted 8.49 billion schillings in two-week securities repurchase agreements at a fixed and unchanged rate of 3.0 percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said seven percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week the central bank allotted 16.44 billion schillings, or 14 percent of bids, also at a rate of 3.0 percent. -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
